        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >After being turned  into a cat against his will (again), Woney wakes in a familiar place,  with little memory of his current situation.  All he knows is there's only one way out; Death. Whether it be his, or anyone who stands in his way.</h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A turn based RPG/roguelike hybrid with an emphasis on story.</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 50 Spells to Pick and Choose from Each Run!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the ever changing and winding halls of a Witch's Manor.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow a quirky, yet haunting story about a Witch's Familiar trying to set himself free.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Optimize until you're a force to be reckoned with in this Turn based Rogue Like!</p></li></ul>",
